/E (Third pass: Glaze PC1087 Sky Blue Light onto the sclera \(not pure white\), light pressure. Deepen the upper lid shadow with PC1081 Chestnut + PC932 Violet to create the hard lash line edge. The upper lash line is the SHARPEST edge in the eye zone; the lower lash stays soft and diffuse \(never mirror\).)
